 Today's newsletter is 894 words, a 3½-minute read. 

 📉 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed down 0.2%.

 Treasury 30-year yields ticked up, hitting their highest level since 2002. 🔥 Today's stock spotlight: Carnival (+13.4%) beat quarterly expectations, saying a significant rebound in demand over the past three months, along with operational improvements, fully offset higher fuel costs.

 
 
